        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\frac{D_{\\text{sin dividir}}-D_{\\text{con división}}}{D_{\\text{sin dividir}}}\n",
        "=\\frac{266{,}433{,}333.33-25{,}230{,}000}{266{,}433{,}333.33}\n",
        "\\approx 0.9053.\n",
        "$$\n",
